	(text "PCB LAYOUT NOTES   (4-layer: L1 Sig / L2 GND / L3 PWR / L4 Sig)\nRF (ANT1, ANT2): 50 ohm CPWG, TOP layer only, NO vias, keep SHORT.\n   Ground-via fence beside each ANT trace; solid L2 GND underneath.\nE22 RF: flood + stitch GND under/around module; no signals under RF.\n   Center pad -> many GND vias.\n+3V3_RF: pour or >=0.5 mm (E22 TX ~1.3 A). At each E22: 100nF closest\n   to VCC (pin 9), then 10uF, then 100uF bulk.\nKeep buck U2 switching node & +3V3_RF away from the ANT traces.\nSeparate the two SMAs / antennas for isolation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18 13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
